{
  "id": "a2-12",
  "level": "A2",
  "number": 12,
  "title": "Past tense: het + ge-",
  "titleAf": "Die verlede tyd",
  "icon": "⏪",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "a2-12-1",
      "title": "One past tense to rule them all",
      "explanation": [
        "Afrikaans has just **one** everyday past tense: **het** + verb with **ge-** in front, placed at the end.",
        "**Ek eet** (I eat) → **Ek het geëet** (I ate / I have eaten).",
        "**Ek speel sokker** → **Ek het sokker gespeel.** Notice: the **ge-** word goes to the **end**.",
        "Verbs that already start with **be-, ge-, her-, ont-, ver-, er-** don't get an extra ge-: **Ek het verstaan**, **Ek het betaal**, **Ek het begin**."
      ],
      "examples": [
        { "af": "Ek het geëet.", "en": "I ate." },
        { "af": "Ons het sokker gespeel.", "en": "We played soccer." },
        { "af": "Sy het 'n boek gelees.", "en": "She read a book." },
        { "af": "Ek het nie verstaan nie.", "en": "I didn't understand." }
      ],
      "vocab": ["het", "eet", "speel", "lees", "koop", "sien", "werk", "betaal", "begin", "gister"],
      "exercises": [
        { "type": "transform", "instruction": "Put it in the past", "from": "Ek eet 'n appel.", "answers": ["Ek het 'n appel geëet."] },
        { "type": "transform", "instruction": "Put it in the past", "from": "Hulle speel sokker.", "answers": ["Hulle het sokker gespeel."] },
        { "type": "transform", "instruction": "Put it in the past", "from": "Ons betaal die rekening.", "answers": ["Ons het die rekening betaal."] },
        { "type": "order", "en": "She read a book yesterday.", "af": "Sy het gister 'n boek gelees." },
        { "type": "fill", "af": "Ek het 'n nuwe kar ___. (bought)", "en": "I bought a new car.", "answers": ["gekoop"], "options": ["gekoop", "koop", "gekoopt"] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "We saw the sea.", "answers": ["Ons het die see gesien."] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "I didn't understand.", "answers": ["Ek het nie verstaan nie."] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a2-12-2",
      "title": "was and had",
      "explanation": [
        "**is** → **was** (was/were): **Ek was moeg.**",
        "**het** (have) → **het gehad** (had): **Ons het 'n lekker tyd gehad.** (We had a great time.)"
      ],
      "examples": [
        { "af": "Ek was gister siek.", "en": "I was sick yesterday." },
        { "af": "Ons het 'n lekker tyd gehad.", "en": "We had a great time." }
      ],
      "vocab": ["was", "wees", "hê", "lekker", "tyd"],
      "exercises": [
        { "type": "transform", "instruction": "Put it in the past", "from": "Hy is moeg.", "answers": ["Hy was moeg."] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "We had a great time.", "answers": ["Ons het 'n lekker tyd gehad."] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "I was sick yesterday.", "answers": ["Ek was gister siek.", "Gister was ek siek."] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
